      "quotes": [
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "Oh hay! I forgot to tell you how to get to the moon.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "But I see you're already at the railgun transport system! Excellent!",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "I'm running a diagnostic now...",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "Just a moment...",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "It appears to be functional. It doesn't have any power tho.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "Well, I hate to bother them, but you're going to need to go see Transistor.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "They can show you how to power this device.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "Their workshop is in the Northwest Pole, but it's probably been snowed in.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "Nimbus has been \"hard at work\" doing what he calls \"disproving the apocalypse\"...",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "So, good luck finding Transistor. They could be anywhere inside their workshop, and they don't usually answer the door. ...or the phone...",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        },
        {
          "characterName": "Moonicorn",
          "text": "But if you do find them, say hi to them for me? Thanks Merky.",
          "imageFileName": "",
          "voiceLineFileName": ""
        }
      ],
